    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "めどが立たない？来週だと一割乗っかりますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No prospect of paying? By next week, another ten percent gets tacked on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "できねえってどういうことだ！ナメてんのか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean you can't pay? Are you messing with us?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もう少しで、年商は百億だったんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just a little longer, and our annual sales would have hit ten billion.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "だからもう聞き飽きたんだよ、お前の自慢話は。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I told you, I am sick and tired of hearing your boasting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "荻原、あといくらだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How much is left on his balance?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "あと一億弱です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just under one hundred million.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ホントにもうどこにもないのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you sure you really have nothing left anywhere?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "サヤカ、行こう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
